00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,390
Welcome to the unit!

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:07,780
What makes good friends? B. Mr.

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:16,330
Wu is asking the Class 1 Grade 8 students what qualities are important in good friends.

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:21,930
Work in groups and share your opinions on this topic.

5
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:26,100
Use the conversation below as a model.

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:30,675
The words in the box may help you.

7
00:00:30,675 --> 00:00:36,350
What do you think makes good friends, boys and girls?

8
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:41,800
Well, I think good friends should be kind and caring.

9
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:47,110
They support you when you are unhappy. Yes, true.

10
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,220
They should also be honest.

11
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:55,540
They don't lie to you, so you can trust them.

12
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:58,250
That's very important.

13
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:02,070
Good friends should be interesting too.

14
00:01:02,070 --> 00:01:07,300
You like to spend time with them because they make you happy.

15
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:13,540
I agree, and they can help you become a better person.

16
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:17,330
Thank you for sharing your thoughts, Class.
